  "en": "Half-wave rectifier",
  "kn": "ಅರ್ಧ-ತರಂಗ ದಿಷ್ಟಕಾರಿ (ರೆಕ್ಟಿಫೈಯರ್)"
 },
 "minutes": 40,
 "blocks": [
  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "intro",
   "heading": {
    "en": "From the wall socket to a phone charger",
    "kn": "ಗೋಡೆಯ ಸಾಕೆಟ್‌ನಿಂದ ಫೋನ್ ಚಾರ್ಜರ್‌ವರೆಗೆ"
   },
   "hook": {
    "en": "The mains gives alternating current, but a phone, a radio or a computer needs steady d.c. The first step is a rectifier, and the simplest one uses a single diode.",
    "kn": "ಮುಖ್ಯ ಸರಬರಾಜು ಪರ್ಯಾಯ ಪ್ರವಾಹ ನೀಡುತ್ತದೆ, ಆದರೆ ಫೋನ್, ರೇಡಿಯೋ, ಕಂಪ್ಯೂಟರ್‌ಗೆ ಸ್ಥಿರ ನೇರ ಪ್ರವಾಹ ಬೇಕು. ಮೊದಲ ಹಂತ ದಿಷ್ಟಕಾರಿ; ಸರಳವಾದದ್ದು ಒಂದೇ ಡಯೋಡ್ ಬಳಸುತ್ತದೆ."
   },
   "objectives": [
    {
     "en": "Explain the working of a half-wave rectifier with waveforms"
    },
    {
     "en": "Derive and use V_dc = V_m/π and I_dc = I_m/π"
    },
    {
     "en": "State the ripple factor, efficiency and PIV"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "The mains gives alternating current, but a phone, a radio or a computer needs steady d.c. The first step is a rectifier, and the simplest one uses a single diode.",
    "kn": "ಮುಖ್ಯ ಸರಬರಾಜು ಪರ್ಯಾಯ ಪ್ರವಾಹ ನೀಡುತ್ತದೆ, ಆದರೆ ಫೋನ್, ರೇಡಿಯೋ, ಕಂಪ್ಯೂಟರ್‌ಗೆ ಸ್ಥಿರ ನೇರ ಪ್ರವಾಹ ಬೇಕು. ಮೊದಲ ಹಂತ ದಿಷ್ಟಕಾರಿ; ಸರಳವಾದದ್ದು ಒಂದೇ ಡಯೋಡ್ ಬಳಸುತ್ತದೆ."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Working of the half-wave rectifier"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "A step-down transformer feeds a diode in series with the load R_L. In the half cycle that makes the anode positive, the diode conducts and the input appears across the load. In the other half cycle the diode is reverse biased and the output is zero. The output is a series of positive half-sine pulses: unidirectional but pulsating, at the input frequency."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "One diode, conducts in one half cycle"
    },
    {
     "en": "Output: pulsating d.c."
    },
    {
     "en": "Ripple frequency = input frequency"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "In a half-wave rectifier, the single diode conducts only in the half cycle that makes its anode positive. The load gets pulsating d.c.",
    "kn": "ಅರ್ಧ-ತರಂಗ ದಿಷ್ಟಕಾರಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಒಂದೇ ಡಯೋಡ್ ತನ್ನ ಆನೋಡ್ ಧನವಾಗುವ ಅರ್ಧ ಚಕ್ರದಲ್ಲಿ ಮಾತ್ರ ವಹಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. ಲೋಡ್‌ಗೆ ಸ್ಪಂದಿಸುವ ನೇರ ಪ್ರವಾಹ ಸಿಗುತ್ತದೆ."
   }
  },
